Error [E2422]: `Never` cannot be used in a value position.
  --> tests/ui/never_return_stored.jet:2:14
    |
  2 |     value :: Never{}
    |              ^^^^^^^
 Why: `Never` has no values; only a function return slot or function-type return slot may promise it (D-NEVER2=B).
 Fix: Move `Never` to a function return type, or use `()`/another value type.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2422
